<title>GERMANY: Bund futures end slightly higher, focus on Ifo.</title>
<headline>Bund futures end slightly higher, focus on Ifo.</headline>
<text>
<p>1634 GMT - Bund futures end slightly higher after spending much of the day in positive territory. Market focused on Ifo index report due 0900 GMT on Tuesday, M3 figures. * 6.25% April 2006 Bund 101.78, yld 5.76 pct (101.78) * March Bund future 101.36(101.33),range so far 101.32-101.74</p>
